WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:39.540
On the brink of defeat...

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:41.840
...Haman Karn was able to escape
the Argama's attacks.

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:47.140
Axis, the enormous meteorite base
that Haman Karn had vacated...

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:51.270
...was about to fall on Granada,
the city on the Moon's surface.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:58.000
The Mirror of Rosamia

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:16.730
We could alter its course by hitting
it with a large nuclear force.

00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:18.510
We can't do that.

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:20.370
It's already too close to the Moon.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:22.910
We should be able to get rid of it
with the Colony Laser.

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:24.440
That's true...

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:27.690
...but with this density of Minovsky particles
we can't reach anyone there.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.420
Not even the Radish?

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:32.320
No, this ship is equipped with
a weak laser.

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:36.390
If only we could use the communication
facilities on Axis to reach Gryps.

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.360
Okay, let's have Torres work on it.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:40.090
We can execute that other
plan too.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:42.260
We'll also use the explosives
on hand?

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:44.230
I guess it's better than nothing.

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:48.160
Have you decided what you'll do?

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.940
I told you to get some rest, Kamille.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:54.840
But if Axis ends up falling on Granada,
it'll be my fault.

00:02:55.510 --> 00:02:57.180
Because I was unable to kill Haman.

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:59.880
Axis would have fallen
even if Haman had been killed.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:01.580
Don't worry about it.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:05.620
You did well just to render
the Qubeley immobile, Kamille.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:08.120
But mobile suits can be repaired.

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.520
If we destroy Haman...

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.790
...they can't fix that.

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:14.470
Kamille!

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:17.270
Since when did you become
such a pessimist?

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:20.300
Since I had enough of it.

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:22.240
Leave Axis to us.

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:25.010
Meanwhile, get some rest, Kamille.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.910
We never know when another mobile suit
battle might break out.

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:28.910
Yes, sir.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:34.250
Kamille Bidan.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.550
He seems to be changing for the better.

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:50.560
Kamille.

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:52.400
You need to get rested.

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:56.940
Kamille.

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:02.600
Hey, once this war is over
things will return to what it was...

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.620
...like us going to school
and fighting over nothing, won't they?

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:07.580
Fa.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.420
Right, Kamille?

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:14.520
Things won't return to what they were.

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:17.260
Because I now have a better understanding
of my duty.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.460
Hey, don't bump it against anything!

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:26.200
I know! Oops!

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:28.230
I'll get some rest.

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:29.430
It'll do you good.

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:31.030
Some quality rest.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:45.680
<i>Rosamia, can you hear me?</i>

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:47.490
Yes, Brother.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:48.920
<i>That's a good girl!</i>

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:50.720
<i>Take two breaths in and one out.</i>

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:52.700
<i>That's right. Slowly.</i>

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:55.060
You're feeling calm,
aren't you, Rosamia?

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:56.630
<i>Yes, Brother.</i>

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:58.870
Okay. Rosamia, head to Axis!

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:01.840
Gates, you stay back and see at what
distance you can sense Rosamia!

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:04.830
Lieutenant Yazan.
Standby on the mobile suit deck!

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.750
Rosamia's okay, is she?

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:08.810
Yes, sir!

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:12.980
She's calmed down, now that we've
made her believe Gates Capa is her brother.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:17.590
<i>Once you get to Axis,</i>
<i>you'll find the Argama.</i>

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.150
<i>You'll also find the Zeta there.</i>

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:21.020
<i>The Zeta is the enemy</i>
<i>that you are to destroy.</i>

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:22.590
Yes.

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:24.590
I understand, Brother!

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:26.260
Now go!

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:44.540
This is a residential district.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.120
This place still has air!

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:07.400
The air hasn't been contaminated.

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:09.110
People must've been here
right to the end.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.110
They haven't shut off
the electricity yet, either.

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.850
This all coincides with the map.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:18.480
The communication facility
is either that...

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:19.640
...that, or...!

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:21.610
What's going on?!

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:24.180
I'll bet it's the Argama
setting off explosives.

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:25.890
Better than nothing, huh?

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:26.720
We'd better hurry!

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:27.490
Yeah.

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:29.220
Let's proceed in two groups.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:30.590
Contact each other
if anything comes up.

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:32.450
Yes. Let's go, Fa!

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:33.670
Right!

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:01.720
It's no use.

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:04.990
We're not going to be able to change
Axis' course doing this.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:10.530
What was that noise?

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.640
No, it's someone's voice.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:23.050
Where is it? Where is it?!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:30.420
I know it's here somewhere... but where?

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:44.300
Kamille!

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:48.830
<i>Where is it?!</i>

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.340
But this isn't Fa's scream.

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:52.880
Is it Four?

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:54.170
Impossible!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:07:59.640
Where is it?

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:01.710
Argama! Where are you?!

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.250
<i>...sami...</i>

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:05.480
<i>Rosa... a... mia...</i>

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:06.990
<i>Can you hear...?</i>

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:08.690
Where are you?! Argama!

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:10.560
<i>Rosamia! It's me, your brother!</i>

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:12.590
<i>Rosamia! Rosamia!</i>

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:14.330
- <i>Rosamia!</i>
- What's the matter, Gates?!

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.530
<i>Communication no longer possible!</i>

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:19.130
- What about the output?!
- <i>Output's at maximum!</i>

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:20.260
Explain the situation!

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:22.910
The Minovsky particles are thicker
than we anticipated.

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:24.640
Without communication,
we can't receive any data.

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:26.340
<i>I can still sense Rosamia.</i>

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:29.510
<i>We don't have to worry about her.</i>

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:31.740
Rosamia's in excellent condition!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.650
Hmm. Good news,
don't you think, Loren?

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:36.690
Yes, sir!

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:38.080
Thank you very much.

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:41.020
A mobile suit team is approaching!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:42.190
What?!

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:45.460
We can see them! They're ours,
but they're not communicating with us.

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:46.590
Must be Scirocco!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.690
Why didn't you notice earlier?!

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:50.000
Because we've been using our
equipment for the experiment!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.260
Forget the excuses!

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:52.600
Send out the Yazan team!

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:00.540
<i>We'll spread out!</i>

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:01.580
<i>Right!</i>

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:08.350
We don't have time!
Send out Gates as well!

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:09.850
Gates is taking part in our experiment!

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:11.910
If we stop now,
Rosamia will become unstable!

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:14.090
I don't care!

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:28.310
<i>Enemy formation consists of twenty!</i>
<i>Stop them, Gates Capa!</i>

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.340
Roger!

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:31.740
<i>There it is!</i>

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:37.270
<i>I found the Argama!</i>

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:40.080
You found it, Rosamia?!

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:50.850
Hey, wait a minute!

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:56.490
<i>Brother!</i>

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:59.590
It's getting stronger.

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:02.070
This sensation...

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:03.910
...it's Four!

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:07.570
Enemy mobile suit!

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:08.610
What?!

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:10.080
Can we counter immediately?!

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:11.110
Impossible!

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:12.740
<i>Zeta Gundam, launching!</i>

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:15.920
Kamille?! Thanks!

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:23.220
Why that's... the Zeta Gundam!

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:32.000
<i>Zeta Gundam!</i>

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:33.230
What is it?

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:34.240
Four?

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:35.300
No, it isn't!

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:39.530
The Zeta's the enemy I am to destroy!

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:47.080
Who's piloting it?!

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:48.220
<i>Die!</i>

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:50.450
Rosammy?! Is it you?!

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:08.770
But that was Four!

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:19.210
<i>I won't let you get away!</i>

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.750
Who is it?

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:13.830
That damn pilot!

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:15.870
Just because my suit can't move...!

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:30.780
Rosammy!

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.390
I knew it! It's you, Rosammy!

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:45.170
Brother?

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.970
That's right. I'm Kamille, your brother.

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:51.840
<i>Kamille! Where have you been?!</i>

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.050
<i>I've been looking for you!</i>

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:55.410
Four?

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:03.320
Four!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:09.220
My head... It hurts...!

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:11.260
<i>We're finally together, Kamille.</i>

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:13.830
<i>I won't ever let you go again.</i>

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:14.830
Four!

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:22.770
Rosammy!!

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:25.800
The Zeta Gundam's stopped moving
at the D5 hatch?!

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:26.910
Y-Yes!

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:30.240
The mobile suit the Zeta encountered...

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:32.780
...was about the size of that
Psyco Gundam.

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.790
What's the matter?

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.790
I chased after Zeta's pilot...

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:46.800
...and then...!

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:53.800
Where is he?! Where did he go?!

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:10.750
Rosammy!

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:13.920
Why do you know my name?

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:17.090
If you're in fact Rosammy,
then why did you come here?

00:14:17.430 --> 00:14:19.860
Why do you know my name?!

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:22.560
I'm Fa, Rosammy!

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:26.430
How could you be Fa?!

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:35.080
Mannequins.

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:43.350
Four.

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:50.900
Four!

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:54.560
Rosammy.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:58.930
Don't you remember?!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.030
You and I knew each other!

00:15:01.110 --> 00:15:02.830
We were together on the Argama
for a while!

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:04.540
Throw that away!

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:07.510
What are you being so scared for?

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:09.210
This is nothing but a yo-yo!

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:11.080
Don't you even remember this toy?

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:12.120
Look!

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:18.750
I feel sorry for you...

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:21.880
...a Cyber-Newtype taught only about
how to fight wars.

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:24.450
What good does it do you?

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.590
It's the same with Newtypes.

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:28.260
There's no such thing to begin with...

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:30.320
...yet this war began all because of it...

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:32.000
...and the people who lived here...

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:34.300
...all went out to fight in the war.

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.930
But you probably wouldn't understand...

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:38.700
...never living with a family before.

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:40.740
I did have a family!

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:43.250
A father, a mother and an older brother!

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:47.080
Those memories you have are false!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.420
No! I have a brother!

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:51.750
Rosammy.

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:54.520
Don't you remember the time
we rode on a boat together?

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:56.490
You're not my brother!

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:59.230
I'm Rosamia! Not Rosammy!

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:01.560
Rosammy!

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:02.830
<i>No!!</i>

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.100
Rosa...!

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:07.470
Brother!

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:08.800
Rosammy!

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:09.600
Kamille!

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:15.410
Four!

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:16.410
Why?

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:18.450
Kamille! What did you just say?!

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:20.680
Fa, return to where the others are
at once!

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:22.520
Wait a minute!

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:24.990
Kamille...!

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:26.850
He said Four...

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:28.550
...although he was talking to Rosammy.

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:39.400
I won't let Scirocco's mobile suit team
get any closer to the Dogosse Gier!

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:41.140
<i>Brother!</i>

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:42.870
What's the matter, Rosamia?!

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:51.250
<i>Brother!!</i>

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:54.350
What's wrong, Rosamia?!

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:03.760
Rosammy!

00:17:13.270 --> 00:17:14.240
What?!

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:23.040
Rosammy!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:44.170
Brother! Where's my brother?!

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:53.840
Stop it, Rosammy!

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:57.910
<i>Brother!</i>

00:17:58.520 --> 00:17:59.510
<i>Help!</i>

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:01.020
<i>Hurry!</i>

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:02.250
Four?!

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:03.650
Why?

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:19.270
Where are you?

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:20.360
Brother!

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:25.170
What happened?!

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:28.210
Sir, that large one is randomly firing
as it approaches us.

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:29.740
What? Where's Kamille?!

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:31.410
Yes, he's on the move!

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:33.810
Haven't we contacted
the Colony Laser yet?

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:36.250
We haven't received word yet!

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:38.860
It's going to ram into Granada!

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:48.830
Please, anyone! Somebody stop her!

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:57.370
Rosammy! Just one more time!

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:59.740
Become the Rosammy
I knew just one more time!

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:00.940
Brother?

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:03.310
That's right! I'm your brother!

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:05.180
Let's ride a boat together again!

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:06.680
You're not him!

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:10.120
Stop it!!

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:22.860
Rosammy.

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:24.630
I feel terrible doing this...

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:26.690
...b-but I need to directly hit you!

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:29.970
<i>Hurry over, Brother!</i>

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:31.540
<i>H- Hurry!</i>

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.950
I-It's Four!

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:38.110
<i>H- Hurry, Kamille!</i>

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:51.360
I found you, Brother!

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:10.610
What's going on?!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:12.270
Gates Capa is acting strange!

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:14.180
Something must've happened to Rosamia.

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.860
Scirocco's mobile suit team
is directly in front of us!

00:21:12.340 --> 00:21:15.680
We did it!
Gryps' laser has altered Axis' course!

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:18.010
Great work, Torres!

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:22.150
I just contacted Gryps using
the communications device.

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:33.230
Perhaps I was too harsh on Miss Rosamia.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:35.930
She's not at fault.

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:40.470
You didn't say anything wrong, Fa.

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:47.940
Neither Newtypes nor Cyber-Newtypes
are really able to make a difference.

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:52.010
Those were your words, Fa.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:53.240
But...!

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:58.720
All we can do is kill others, isn't it?

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:00.450
Kamille...!

00:22:09.270 --> 00:22:10.560
Don't worry too much about it.

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:12.700
I'm not worrying about it.

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:16.030
If I did, I couldn't live with myself
being a Newtype, could I?

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:25.010
Axis has changed its course.

00:22:25.080 --> 00:22:29.180
However, in its shadow,
many lives were lost.

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:31.420
And both these facts...

00:22:31.790 --> 00:22:34.380
...will gravely affect the destinies
of many people.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:45.260 --> 00:23:48.660
The final battle between the A.E.U.G.
and the Titans begins.

00:23:49.730 --> 00:23:54.070
Lives of individuals that would not be lost
if they had not met one another...

00:23:54.470 --> 00:23:57.130
...are absorbed into outer space,
one after another.

00:23:58.140 --> 00:24:01.940
Battles come with a fate
that must be decorated with blood.

00:24:02.910 --> 00:24:07.480
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"Casualties of War".

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Casualties of War

00:24:08.490 --> 00:24:10.890
You will see the tears of time.
